  "description": "\"We're going to keep clinging to each other like dogs in heat—\"\nThat flimsy word first love isn't nearly enough to describe it.\nSeo Nayoon left Do Jinhan half-ruined, emotionally wrecked.\n\"Do Jinhan. Please, just pretend you don’t know me.\"\nWith those absurd words, I disappeared from his life…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285000515), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11779079), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066160), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/cozy_obsession), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66110782), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260195), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/8765)",
